THE PROJECT &nbsp; 📝 &nbsp;

As a Senior Software Engineer, you will be engaged to deliver key initiatives that strengthen the security and resilience of Form3's cloud-native payments platform. Working within a collaborative engineering environment, you will design, build, and implement capabilities that enhance the security, trust, and resilience of our systems while supporting the delivery of defined project outcomes.

This engagement is centred on hands-on software engineering and security-focused platform development. You'll apply your expertise across areas such as API security, cryptographic controls, AI governance, software supply chain security, and automated security tooling to deliver production-ready solutions. Working alongside engineers, platform specialists, and security experts, you'll focus on delivering scalable, maintainable capabilities that can be embedded into the software development lifecycle and provide lasting value beyond the engagement.

